---
title: Credits
description: Who drew the icons in GGE Command and these docs, and the licence they use. GGE Command is not affiliated with Goodgame Studios.
---

The small pictures in GGE Command and in these docs are glyphs from game-icons.net. Independent artists drew them, and this page names each one. We set every glyph in our own round badge and do not change the drawing.

## Icon licence {% #licence %}

The glyphs use the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 licence (CC BY 3.0). You may share and adapt them if you credit the artist, which the list below does. Each name links to the glyph's page on game-icons.net.

