## Not affiliated {% #disclaimer %}

GGE Command is an independent product by Neise Solutions. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Goodgame Studios. Goodgame Empire and the names of its events and features belong to their owners, and we use them only to say what our tool works with. Pictures in these docs come from our own app and the icon set above, never from the game.
